sequenceDiagram
  participant Worker as RQ Worker
  participant Graph as LangGraph StateGraph
  participant MCP as MCP Server
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant API
  participant Reviewer as HR / Bid Manager

  Worker->>Graph: ainvoke(state, thread_id=match_id)
  Graph->>Graph: normalize_skills -> score (hard filters)
  Graph->>Graph: judge_qualitative_fit (LLM)
  Graph->>MCP: calibrate_against_history (sector lookup)
  Graph->>Graph: detect_anomalies (rules + LLM pass)
  Graph->>Graph: generate_report (citation ledger)
  Graph->>Graph: human_review interrupt()
  Graph-->>Worker: paused state
  Worker->>DB: write match_results/anomalies (decision = NULL)
  Reviewer->>API: POST /matches/{id}/review
  API->>Graph: aget_state() then Command(resume=decision)
  Graph-->>API: resumed, finalized
  API->>DB: update match_results + historical_decisions
